From: PonWrt developers <noreply@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] hg5585f: add LuCI dashboard and remove simulation tests

Add the pinned Airoha NPU LuCI dashboard and remove custom post-build simulation tests.

Signed-off-by: PonWrt developers <noreply@localhost>
---
